{"title":"2011 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 3a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(slow,_only_use_when_bored)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (slow, only use when bored)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(faster)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (faster)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2011 CEMC Euclid Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/5/2959bbe6ec0076108a27aadfc5f631b7337f7958.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\leq x \\leq 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"79\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/2/fe2294bb5c32896fd6ff3eb508de4c834be74c84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 \\leq y \\leq 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"17\" />, what is the maximum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/9/ac9f71d2eaf5ebd373982a551534a71406c6fb98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{y}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"34\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28slow.2C_only_use_when_bored.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(slow,_only_use_when_bored)\">Solution 1 (slow, only use when bored)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (slow, only use when bored)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can try every possible combination to see what is the largest:\n</p><p>First, we can check for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, second <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/0/690ef55a607beaf2389d1ee102df817721bc2392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, third <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea768618848c1aea8a32490c327911e8ab7243a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/3/c43970aa97091f384854d477a1e1e07356887266.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> last\n</p><p>For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/c/d1c4d4d271c5c4dc51fcf7c5e2dee14a7c7fae47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/1/c211f8d8dad73263c1977189cdf2268e730c51a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{10}{2} = 15 - 5 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"181\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/3/c832e4ebb5fc13830ee1f7897c5ac56e83f94e58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/d/66d62701a2408703945b875ddad1757dda5e6319.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{11}{2} = 15 - 5.5 = 9.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"200\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than the value that we got previously, so we discard it.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/d/dad67f07090b95b6ca3a2df8c02b48e905e885ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/e/c8ea31201a015a99eaae3ebcb3349601ad505d5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{12}{2} = 15 - 6 = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"171\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/7/f0760e265c688498d8376016a70a86c33fc69c8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/b/88bcecd7658a150f5043813ca351c7c9e73c7036.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{13}{2} = 15 - 6.5 = 8.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"200\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/c/33c647f61ff361b92bf16293a553c62d8bfcc496.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/4/e34ca6a381bea5377ee4d1e94f58daa3b3f357ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{14}{2} = 15 - 7 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"171\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/2/e72f4e786a600794c0fad929720e59b54bb4b038.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/7/7776f763e033f7e92ba23d65e8c0029c8ce71e01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{15}{2} = 15 - 7 = 8.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"186\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/3/383adbe9f38f5604f3ccff08d2a65a2f7ab86a74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/2/e42138b6af107e832e11ec651f5db2f66302d88d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{16}{2} = 15 - 8 = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"171\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/4/994f2282fff9dbf225d2fe2dee59f9c571189689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/8/048e428de3c438c8ea53beec9912414454a03e10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{17}{2} = 15 - 8.5 = 6.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"200\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/a/e5a1a2b5979a1a16d49f048563190c8e0d505e0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/2/4b21775645e02fec892355b4de8ddfde78a583db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{18}{2} = 15 - 9 = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"171\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/5/20552e847f4d11e90f70aec6470963e45785af74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/3/da3a5a7801f9468e541747c570759bc146fe6c04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{19}{2} = 15 - 9.5 = 5.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"200\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/e/bceaaf56dd8ffb0cd67010272ec09d10ec5c5a0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/d/bddbc41f00392c8c7d81393a980df60b1fd78ed3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{20}{2} = 15 - 10 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"181\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>From this, our current maximum was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Next, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/0/690ef55a607beaf2389d1ee102df817721bc2392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/c/d1c4d4d271c5c4dc51fcf7c5e2dee14a7c7fae47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/a/20a8ef414a829af9306aebe6e3ef192709678908.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{10}{3} = 15 - 3.\\overline{3} = 11.\\overline{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"209\" height=\"38\" />. This is larger than our current maximum, so we have got a new maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/3/c832e4ebb5fc13830ee1f7897c5ac56e83f94e58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/0/600a4981fde3a03e9c64a00a0d7f5330cbcb92f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{11}{3} = 15 - 3.\\overline{6} = 11.\\overline{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"209\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/d/dad67f07090b95b6ca3a2df8c02b48e905e885ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/5/15565ed0e980d00409303e06f927d141a73bc501.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{12}{3} = 15 - 4 = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"181\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/7/f0760e265c688498d8376016a70a86c33fc69c8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/3/533a38f14b7189641b3d3d829f561fb6b672c26d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{13}{3} = 15 - 4.\\overline{3} = 10.\\overline{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"209\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/c/33c647f61ff361b92bf16293a553c62d8bfcc496.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/8/56862212c9c6bef120ccf523b4b0f7349eadf458.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{14}{3} = 15 - 4.\\overline{6} = 10.\\overline{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"209\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/2/e72f4e786a600794c0fad929720e59b54bb4b038.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/5/4251a55f8371c7a50b23a71a0f73eb6f091d6d32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{15}{3} = 15 - 5 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"181\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/3/383adbe9f38f5604f3ccff08d2a65a2f7ab86a74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/8/8b86145903db890ac36f983f5dcbf3cf188309d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{16}{3} = 15 - 5.\\overline{3} = 9.\\overline{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"200\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/4/994f2282fff9dbf225d2fe2dee59f9c571189689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b54e0c7ec8f5a72fb383c4dc33094dd32a95e94.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{17}{3} = 15 - 5.\\overline{6} = 9.\\overline{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"200\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/a/e5a1a2b5979a1a16d49f048563190c8e0d505e0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/b/a2b78324972e360333d65fa4d367019db01a6a8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{18}{3} = 15 - 6 = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"171\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/5/20552e847f4d11e90f70aec6470963e45785af74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/0/8f0b64cc3907050b6cb78d34ad9e442097cdcf2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{19}{3} = 15 - 6.\\overline{3} = 8.\\overline{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"200\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/e/bceaaf56dd8ffb0cd67010272ec09d10ec5c5a0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/0/d00f1e0538f68a557c9d3c54703d5a43ce9f57e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{20}{3} = 15 - 6.\\overline{6} = 8.\\overline{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"200\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>Our new maximum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51d7e4d404bc64ee2363762e23f919df8e912fbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11.\\overline{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"34\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Next, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea768618848c1aea8a32490c327911e8ab7243a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/c/d1c4d4d271c5c4dc51fcf7c5e2dee14a7c7fae47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/1/1314bc7d20552e0f49bfa638682eb927cca4aac7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{10}{4} = 15 - 2.5 = 12.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"209\" height=\"38\" />. This is larger than our current maximum, so we have got a new maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/3/c832e4ebb5fc13830ee1f7897c5ac56e83f94e58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/8/e786adf32b409e5e3a9ce9297a83a1bf75e622ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{11}{4} = 15 - 2.75 = 12.25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"227\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/d/dad67f07090b95b6ca3a2df8c02b48e905e885ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/e/78e685ea9588ab18c397558489c475e92302fe5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{12}{4} = 15 - 3 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"181\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/7/f0760e265c688498d8376016a70a86c33fc69c8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/f/78fb96c3add3df56f041630ee295b6e39c59fb5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{13}{4} = 15 - 3.25 = 11.75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"227\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/c/33c647f61ff361b92bf16293a553c62d8bfcc496.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/1/781cd44e6bc3d21c5dd34431a61440f6e76c8604.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{14}{4} = 15 - 3.5 = 11.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"209\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/2/e72f4e786a600794c0fad929720e59b54bb4b038.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a48b4a3a2291af3c1ce3e2d12fc6806c24bb17e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{15}{4} = 15 - 3.75 = 11.25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"227\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/3/383adbe9f38f5604f3ccff08d2a65a2f7ab86a74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/1/dc18a3ee92ca687e4ea2aaa553ee3d71aec34636.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{16}{4} = 15 - 4 = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"181\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/4/994f2282fff9dbf225d2fe2dee59f9c571189689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2ef8677c9a4c987543b5dbc6def4ff30c2c2b260.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{17}{4} = 15 - 4.25 = 10.75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"227\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/a/e5a1a2b5979a1a16d49f048563190c8e0d505e0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/0/1a00295ecbdb9cba3ab96784af14c158ca8f3e2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{18}{4} = 15 - 4.5 = 10.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"209\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/5/20552e847f4d11e90f70aec6470963e45785af74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/6/f8615045cf04a325f81908020ad43f505bc55e31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{19}{4} = 15 - 4.75 = 10.25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"227\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/e/bceaaf56dd8ffb0cd67010272ec09d10ec5c5a0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/8/2180bc3ecc2c5e42d7c4b8ec70dab5cc69de3e72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{20}{4} = 15 - 5 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"181\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>Our current maximum is now <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/a/b0aca084b717ca0355a18189d9ae818743c9b682.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"31\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Last, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/3/c43970aa97091f384854d477a1e1e07356887266.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/c/d1c4d4d271c5c4dc51fcf7c5e2dee14a7c7fae47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/4/344736d4042cd050a664b8ccba501d90dcbad2fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{10}{5} = 15 - 2 = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"181\" height=\"38\" />. This is larger than our current maximum, so we have got a new maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/3/c832e4ebb5fc13830ee1f7897c5ac56e83f94e58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/f/8df6f0722956fbdf6787758b0e8cebfeb1dec4f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{11}{5} = 15 - 2.2 = 12.8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"209\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/d/dad67f07090b95b6ca3a2df8c02b48e905e885ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/f/35f55361470a2c302d100a116ef3f75a5215524e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{12}{5} = 15 - 2.4 = 12.6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"209\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/7/f0760e265c688498d8376016a70a86c33fc69c8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/8/e48de6eb2f0f84cf0ef9f68197b0db2ef8247772.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{13}{5} = 15 - 2.6 = 12.4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"209\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/c/33c647f61ff361b92bf16293a553c62d8bfcc496.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/1/131e9dadc5b5c1e6a776667e57bccb42d2210622.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{14}{5} = 15 - 2.8 = 12.2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"209\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/2/e72f4e786a600794c0fad929720e59b54bb4b038.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/4/d4421ac24d068a43c42613f1094cec3659bf4636.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{15}{5} = 15 - 3 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"181\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/3/383adbe9f38f5604f3ccff08d2a65a2f7ab86a74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/a/49adedc1b2e01723ccfcf9605d7e61470f7b89d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{16}{5} = 15 - 3.2 = 11.8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"209\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/4/994f2282fff9dbf225d2fe2dee59f9c571189689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/6/486f0982da1a7489f6f7820d128ef4407a3a6293.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{17}{5} = 15 - 3.4 = 11.6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"209\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/a/e5a1a2b5979a1a16d49f048563190c8e0d505e0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/d/d7d962066b88de9b980ede9bdaf9957df87d6a8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{18}{5} = 15 - 3.6 = 11.4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"209\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/5/20552e847f4d11e90f70aec6470963e45785af74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/3/c037dc734cf709e25b0bb396d3c4c8f3f87f8add.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{19}{5} = 15 - 3.8 = 11.2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"209\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/e/bceaaf56dd8ffb0cd67010272ec09d10ec5c5a0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/4/474a4de949caa5e13f24b641221bcedad2687a34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{20}{5} = 15 - 4 = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"181\" height=\"38\" />. This is lower than our current maximum.\n</p><p>Thus, our maximum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/e/25e40bc2b9bcef49b195e9be1e88febb6eff5fd6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28faster.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(faster)\">Solution 2 (faster)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (faster)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realize that for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/9/ac9f71d2eaf5ebd373982a551534a71406c6fb98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{y}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"34\" /> to be maximized, we want a smaller value to be subtracted from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so we want to minimize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/7/c471843498de1d9d0b05ad7f32eab45e216577b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{y}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"12\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p><p>As the denominator of a fraction increases, the value of the fraction decreases and vice-versa. As the numerator of a fraction decreases, the value of the fraction decreases. This means that we want to maximize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and minimize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>From the inequalities, the smallest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and the largest possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/a/55a1cd5d3c85f39c37603b70a89998d124880958.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{y}{x} = \\frac{10}{5} = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"96\" height=\"38\" />. This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/8/d980a1145cc536f8b6cc0df4bbe0835e65ae2c09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 - \\frac{y}{x} = 15 - 2 = \\boxed{13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"184\" height=\"34\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017224730\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 561/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 21610/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.045      1 2011_CEMC_Euclid_Problems/Problem_3\n100.00%    6.045      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36064:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017224730 and revision id 279800. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}